    "updated_at": "2021-04-17T08:46:28Z",
    "body": "For powershell you can do this to hook the prompt after starship has been initialised:\r\n```powershell\r\n$old_prompt = $function:prompt\r\nfunction prompt {\r\n    # Insert your hook here\r\n\r\n    & $old_prompt\r\n }\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
